      "lines": [
        "584. 化简：",
        "1) $-8x+5.2a+3x+5a$；",
        "2) $5a+7a-9.2m+15m$；",
        "3) $-a+x+1.1a-1.3x$；",
        "4) $-12p+3k+3.2p-2.3k$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "585",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "585. 去括号并合并同类项：",
        "1) $7\\cdot(2x-3)+4\\cdot(3x-2)$；",
        "2) $-2\\cdot(4k+8)-3\\cdot(5k-1)$；",
        "3) $-8\\cdot(2-2y)+4\\cdot(3-4y)$；",
        "4) $-5\\cdot(-2x+4)-(10-x)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "586",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "586. 化简：",
        "1) $(3x-11)\\cdot2-5\\cdot(4-3x)$；",
        "2) $(8a-1)\\cdot(-6)+(3a-7)\\cdot(-2)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "587",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "587. 求下列各式的值：",
        "1) $4x-2a+6x-3a+4a$，当$x=-0.15,a=0.03$时；",
        "2) $-6\\cdot(3m+8)-3\\cdot(m-5)$，当$m=20.8$时."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "588",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "588. 解方程：",
        "1) $3\\cdot(2x+8)-(5x+2)=0$；",
        "2) $-3\\cdot(3y+4)+4\\cdot(2y-1)=0$；",
        "3) $5\\cdot(7-3x)+7\\cdot(2+2x)=0$；",
        "4) $8\\cdot(3-2x)+5\\cdot(3x+5)=9$."
      ]
    },
